00:25:27,145 --> 00:25:28,226
[SPEAKER_00]: Go ahead.

290
00:25:28,406 --> 00:25:37,735
[SPEAKER_02]: So, it says, it's like when the rain pours down on a mountaintop, and the water flows downhill to fill the hollows, the crevices, and the creeks.

291
00:25:38,895 --> 00:25:40,996
[SPEAKER_02]: As they become full, they fill up the pools.

292
00:25:41,416 --> 00:25:43,296
[SPEAKER_02]: The pools fill up the lakes.

293
00:25:43,316 --> 00:25:44,537
[SPEAKER_02]: The lakes fill up the streams.

294
00:25:44,597 --> 00:25:45,097
[SPEAKER_02]: It accumulates.

295
00:25:45,117 --> 00:25:46,277
[SPEAKER_02]: The streams fill up the rivers.

296
00:25:46,297 --> 00:25:46,657
[SPEAKER_02]: Spills over.

297
00:25:47,318 --> 00:25:50,278
[SPEAKER_02]: And as the rivers become full, they fill up the ocean.

298
00:25:51,099 --> 00:25:51,219
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

299
00:25:51,539 --> 00:25:53,039
[SPEAKER_02]: That's the fuel for the ocean.

300
00:25:53,419 --> 00:25:54,940
[SPEAKER_02]: And that's how it is filled up.

301
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:59,561
[SPEAKER_02]: In the same way, when the factor of associating with...

302
00:25:59,581 --> 00:26:02,682
[SPEAKER_02]: So, these are the factors we didn't come to yet.

303
00:26:02,762 --> 00:26:03,042
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

304
00:26:03,082 --> 00:26:03,943
[SPEAKER_02]: So,

305
00:26:06,021 --> 00:26:15,909
[SPEAKER_02]: When the factor of associating with bad people is fulfilled, it fulfills the factor of listening to an untrue teaching.

306
00:26:15,929 --> 00:26:20,593
[SPEAKER_02]: When the factor of listening to an untrue teaching is fulfilled, it fulfills the factor of a lack of faith.

307
00:26:22,333 --> 00:26:25,114
[SPEAKER_00]: And then... And that's exactly what I've been describing.

308
00:26:25,174 --> 00:26:30,575
[SPEAKER_00]: See, like, it doesn't mean untrue teachings from some ridiculously, like, wrong views.

309
00:26:30,595 --> 00:26:33,296
[SPEAKER_00]: No, means simply the wrong instructions.

310
00:26:33,516 --> 00:26:36,217
[SPEAKER_00]: Instructions not clear enough, not emphasizing the right things.

311
00:26:36,317 --> 00:26:45,919
[SPEAKER_00]: So, you will lack faith, means basically you will lack ability to emphasize that which doesn't seem

312
00:26:47,353 --> 00:26:48,394
[SPEAKER_00]: Natural to emphasize.

313
00:26:48,694 --> 00:26:51,957
[SPEAKER_00]: That doesn't seem the most important or pressing thing to emphasize.

314
00:26:53,017 --> 00:26:53,958
[SPEAKER_00]: You won't emphasize it.

315
00:26:54,258 --> 00:26:56,300
[SPEAKER_01]: You'll emphasize what you think you should emphasize.

316
00:26:56,320 --> 00:27:13,373
[SPEAKER_00]: When you start hearing the... so somebody... you come across the teaching that's actually rightly expounded and tells you, well, you should stop emphasizing your views, you should stop emphasizing the end result of it, and start foreseeing how these things occur, not in terms of psychologizing and just explain to yourself how this happened,

317
00:27:14,111 --> 00:27:22,153
[SPEAKER_00]: But the moments, the day when you are deciding to go against the sense restraint or distraction, you start emphasizing that.

318
00:27:22,633 --> 00:27:26,714
[SPEAKER_00]: And as I said, you will have no immediate criteria that that's the right way to do it.

319
00:27:26,734 --> 00:27:28,614
[SPEAKER_00]: Because you're pressured on the level of the views.

320
00:27:28,674 --> 00:27:33,075
[SPEAKER_00]: You're pressured to clarify the views, to resolve the views, to attain the views.

321
00:27:34,115 --> 00:27:41,617
[SPEAKER_00]: But it's like, yeah, well, you gotta put that second and actually emphasize body, speech and mind, actions, routine, greed, aversion, delusion.

