00:27:44,887 --> 00:27:45,227
[SPEAKER_00]: What now?

324
00:27:45,267 --> 00:27:45,928
[SPEAKER_00]: Where is my view?

325
00:27:45,968 --> 00:27:46,588
[SPEAKER_00]: Where is my view?

326
00:27:46,628 --> 00:27:52,393
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, you have to have faith and keep emphasizing the right order of things, the right development.

327
00:27:53,094 --> 00:27:59,059
[SPEAKER_00]: And then, your own pressure of where are my views and what's happening will subside.

328
00:28:00,300 --> 00:28:00,981
[SPEAKER_03]: It's like, eh...

329
00:28:01,563 --> 00:28:06,228
[SPEAKER_01]: I think it relates back to what you were just saying about that pressure.

330
00:28:07,209 --> 00:28:15,379
[SPEAKER_03]: You're trying to be sense-restrained, and then pressure builds up, and at some point you break the sense-restraint, and then, oh, damn, I broke it again.

331
00:28:16,420 --> 00:28:18,342
[SPEAKER_03]: It's like, it can kind of...

332
00:28:19,403 --> 00:28:28,409
[SPEAKER_03]: I think that, oh, like, oh, because I acted out of it, therefore, this danger and problems that I thought I was understanding, must not be clear enough.

333
00:28:28,449 --> 00:28:29,730
[SPEAKER_03]: I must think about it more.

334
00:28:30,791 --> 00:28:37,196
[SPEAKER_00]: And that's completely, like, the wrong... Yeah, you can think about it more, but you need to realize that

335
00:28:38,785 --> 00:28:45,269
[SPEAKER_00]: Doesn't matter how much you kind of manage to sort of build up that inspirational kind of thinking, it will fade away.

336
00:28:45,309 --> 00:28:45,829
[SPEAKER_00]: It's natural.

337
00:28:45,929 --> 00:28:48,091
[SPEAKER_00]: Things come and go.

338
00:28:48,511 --> 00:28:56,235
[SPEAKER_00]: So, you still have to then recognize that you really need to start emphasizing that, the behavioral aspect of it, and things that you won't do.

339
00:28:56,616 --> 00:28:59,897
[SPEAKER_00]: And see, the pressure will build up inevitably.

340
00:29:01,038 --> 00:29:03,560
[SPEAKER_00]: And then, you realize, okay, I need to act out.

341
00:29:04,490 --> 00:29:07,933
